msgid "Weather Lockscreen"
msgstr "天气锁屏"

msgid "Displays weather information on the sleep screen. Select Weather option in Sleep screen > Wallpaper menu to enable."
msgstr "在睡眠屏幕上显示天气信息。在睡眠屏幕 > 壁纸菜单中选择“天气”选项以启用。"

