msgid "Cache Settings"
msgstr "缓存设置"

msgid "Maximum Cache duration"
msgstr "最长缓存时长"

msgid "When offline, cached weather data up to this age will be shown. Older data displays the configured fallback instead."
msgstr "离线时,会显示不超过此时长的缓存天气数据。更旧的数据将显示配置的备用内容。"

msgid "Minimum Cache duration"
msgstr "最短缓存时长"

msgid "Minimum time between API requests when locking device. Within this period, cached data is used automatically."
msgstr "锁定设备时两次 API 请求之间的最短时间。在此期间内会自动使用缓存数据。"

msgid "Debug: Controls minimum time between API requests. Does not affect periodic refresh intervals."
msgstr "调试:控制 API 请求之间的最短时间。不影响定期刷新间隔。"

